    "fullText": "acknowledgements — Rausse\n(hydrotherapy and nutrition); Jethro Kloss (herbal healer); Paul Twitchell\n(mapping the heavens); Darwin Gross (a true master); Dr.  Harvey Kellogg\n(detoxification), and T. C.  McDaniel, D. O.  (chemistry). \nSpecial thanks to Brenda, Tony, Kathie, Theresa and Jennifer for all their\nhelp and valuable assistance in putting this information together in a cohesive\nform and for helping to keep our organization a true God company. \nThere are so many great healers and scientists that I couldn’t possibly\nmention them all.  I send my humblest apologies to those whom I did not\nmention.  A great healer or scientist is not swayed by humanity’s conditioning\nor monetary systems.  Rather, he or she forges ahead seeking truth so all can\nbenefit."
