    "fullText": "The Detox Miracle Sourcebook is about this second option, true healing — I\nhave seen spinal cord injuries reconnect and nerve damage from strokes,\nmultiple sclerosis and the like, heal. \nThere is no magic or mystery to health or disease.  Disease is a natural\nprocess!  When we understand how the body works, and what causes the\ntissues in the body to fail, we will then understand what causes disease\nsymptoms, and how to reverse it. \nThis book will take you on a journey with many important stops along\nthe way.  You will learn about the species your physical body comes from;\nhow your body works; the nature of disease.  And finally, what health is."
