    "excerpt": "Consuming your foods juiced and/or eating them raw will help tremendously\nin revitalizing your pancreas and yourself. \nIt is beyond the scope of this book to explore further on the subject of\nenzymes as biocatalysts.  However, it is enough to reiterate that life begets life\nand death begets death.  Without enzymes we h...",
    "fullText": "Enzymes are destroyed when subjected to temperatures starting from — Consuming your foods juiced and/or eating them raw will help tremendously\nin revitalizing your pancreas and yourself. \nIt is beyond the scope of this book to explore further on the subject of\nenzymes as biocatalysts.  However, it is enough to reiterate that life begets life\nand death begets death.  Without enzymes we have death. \nEnjoy the natural flavors of fresh, whole, ripe and raw foods.  God has\ngiven us a smorgasbord of foods and the ability to obtain them.  Seek out\norganic, fresh and raw, enzyme-rich foods, as enzymes are the keys to life."
