    "fullText": "Vaccination Facts — This\nhappens the same way that you, in every moment, express yourself according\nto the experiences you have and the memory of these experiences.  Your cells\nare no different.  With each minute, hour, day ...  the strength or weakness of\neach of your cells becomes a part of its memory patterns in DNA and\nchromosomes. \nAt the moment of conception the condition of each cell and its memories\nthat are passed down to you become a part of your body, and thus determine\nhow your body functions and the conditions that it can experience.  Since we\nkeep making our genetic condition weaker by continuing to wear down our\nbodies through diet and lifestyle we are seeing a landslide of chronic cellular\nand tissue weaknesses.  We then pass them on to our children, who then pass\nthem on to their children.  And with each successive generation, the cellular\npatterns and functions become more chronic, causing disease symptoms to\nappear now in infants."
