    "fullText": "Tonsillitis — Tonsillitis\nStiff neck\nCervical spine deterioration from stagnant lymph system in neck\n(especially when tonsils have been removed)\nDandruff\nKidneys and Bladder (Eliminative/Urinary Tract System)\nThese organs are vital in your body’s elimination process.  Without proper\nelimination of metabolic wastes, both cellular and digestive, toxic by-products\nwill cause auto-intoxication of cells.  This causes cellular weakness and death. \nThe following are side effects or warning signals that your body experiences\nwhen the kidneys and bladder become weak."
