    "excerpt": "A few people who have chosen\nto suppress their body’s need to cleanse itself (through steroids like\nprednisone) will have some deeper issues.  However, those who are more\nlikely to experience the severe effects are the chronically toxic from birth,\nwho manifest cancer, H. I. V.  and/or other serious illnesses. \nTWO CAS...",
    "fullText": "Paralysis of any part of the body — A few people who have chosen\nto suppress their body’s need to cleanse itself (through steroids like\nprednisone) will have some deeper issues.  However, those who are more\nlikely to experience the severe effects are the chronically toxic from birth,\nwho manifest cancer, H. I. V.  and/or other serious illnesses. \nTWO CASES OF CLEANSING\n \nLet’s examine two cases that exemplify the healing crisis. \nCase 1\nA thirty-six-year-old female with pancreatic cancer.  This was the\ndegenerative type of cancer that shut her pancreas down.  Very little of any\ndigestive activity was left."
