    "excerpt": "I\nalso used liquid botanical extracts to enhance various organs and glands in\nher body, especially the pancreas.  I finally added solid foods starting with\nfruits, again because of their high energy levels and ease of digestion.  Finally\nin eleven months, she was cancer free! \nWater Fasting\nThis is the fourth and ultim...",
    "fullText": "I highly recommend this type of fast. — I\nalso used liquid botanical extracts to enhance various organs and glands in\nher body, especially the pancreas.  I finally added solid foods starting with\nfruits, again because of their high energy levels and ease of digestion.  Finally\nin eleven months, she was cancer free! \nWater Fasting\nThis is the fourth and ultimate type of fasting.  Water fasts should only be\ndone with R/O (reverse osmosis) or distilled water.  At this level, your\ndigestive energy is totally given to the immune, lymphatic and glandular\nsystems.  A water fast creates a high level of body cleansing and purging."
