    "fullText": "Fruit — 2. Fruit\n3. Melon\nSalad may consist of any raw vegetables. (See additional salad\nsuggestions among recipes in Module 7.9.)\n \nBetween Meal Juice\nSee recommended juices.\n \nDinner\nChoose one.\n \n1. Large Salad\n2. Fruit\n3. Melon\nSalad may consist of any raw vegetables. (See additional salad\nsuggestions among recipes in Module 7.9.)\n \nSnacks\nIn between meals, snacks must consist of fresh fruits, raw vegetables, and\nfruit or vegetable juices only.\n \nRecommended Juices\nVegetable juices:\n \ncarrot, spinach, parsley, dandelion greens. (See Module 7.7, which\nfollows, for more juice combination suggestions.)\n \nFruit juices:"
