    "fullText": "importance of this in cancer, injuries, or any disease or depletion issue is — 8, and read about juice\nfasting for more encouragement about the tremendous benefits of juices. \nRemember fruit juices are great brain, nerve and glandular foods.  They are\nthe cleansers of the body as well.  Vegetable juices rebuild the structure of the\nbody especially bone, muscle and connective tissue. \nYour body will go through cycles in which you will crave fruit juices\nand fruits only.  Then there will be a time when your body craves vegetable\njuices and vegetables.  Listen and flow with these cravings.  The body knows\nwhat it is doing and what it needs.  One of our greatest shortcomings is that\nwe don’t listen.  People don’t listen to God or to their own bodies."
