    "fullText": "Bell peppers (all colors) — Bell peppers (all colors)\n \nTomatoes\n \nOnions\n \nAsparagus\n \nAvocado\n \nCabbage (red or white)\n \nGreen beans\n \nCarrots\n \nSweet corn\n \nAny dark green leafy vegetable\n \nMake your salad fun and filled with a rainbow of colored vegetables. Use\nonly small amounts of dressing. (See Raw Dressing recipe in this section.)\nFor those who wish oil on the salad use only raw organic olive, coconut or\ngrape seed oil. Enjoy the natural flavors of vegetables.\nRelish\n2 cups sweet corn, cut right from the cob\n \n1/4 cup sweet onions, chopped\n \n1/4 cup red bell peppers, chopped"
