    "fullText": "stronger effect upon the body than single herbs. — stronger effect upon the body than single herbs.  There are many things to\nconsider when combining herbs, such as compatibility, synergistic actions\nand effects to related tissues.  In Module 8. 3 I will suggest an ideal herbal\ntincture or blend for each of ten major conditions, including adrenal gland\nenhancement, parasite cleansing, and kidney and bladder functioning. \nI n Module 8. 4 you will find the body systems listed once again\n(Cardiovascular, Digestive, etc. ), with suggestions for herbal detoxifiers and\nstrengtheners for each system.  Finally, we will close with an important\nconsideration of pharmaceutical antibiotics vs.  nature’s anti-parasitics in\nModule 8. 5. \nHave fun with herbs and herbal formulas, for their power and strength is\nmuch needed in today’s world.  With the use of herbs to clean and rebuild the\nbody, vibrant health can be achieved by anyone who is willing to put his/her\nheart into it.  Do not be afraid of what God created for your use."
