    "fullText": "An excellent diuretic. — Actions: Alterative (cooling), anthelmintic (vermicide), antiseptic,\nantisyphilitic, anti-venomous, astringent, deobstruent, depurant,\ndiuretic, emollient, refrigerant, styptic and vulnerary. \nPoke Root (a. k. a.  Pokeweed)\nThe tumor buster.  One of the best for abscesses, boils and masses. \nEncourages movement in the lymphatic system. \nUsed for enlarged or hardened organs and glands (thyroid, spleen, liver,\netc. ). \nHas some mild cardiac-depressant qualities. \nSkin cleanser especially good for eczema, dermatitis and psoriasis. \nIncreases bile and digestive juices."
