    "fullText": "Promotes kidney function. — Actions: Alterative, antispasmodic, somewhat depurative, antitumor,\ndeobstruent, detergent, expectorant, nutritive, sedative and stimulant\n(slightly). \nRed Raspberry\nOne of nature’s top female herbs. \nConsidered a nutritive tonic. \nA specific in pregnancy, and produces a far less painful and more natural\ndelivery. \nStrengthens both mother and fetus during childbearing. \nChecks hemorrhages, especially during labor. \nEnriches mother’s milk. \nA great herb for cleansing the male and female reproductive organs."
