    "fullText": "General: 2 capsules, 3 times a day. — )\nRed Raspberry Leaf (Rubus idaeus)\nBlack Haw Bark (Viburnum prunijolium)\nPrickly Ash Bark (Zanthoxylum clava-Herculis)\nINDICATIONS\nAll female reproductive issues including dys-menorrhea (painful\nmenstruation), amenorrhea (lack of proper menstruation), PMS, and\novulation disorders.  Discharges (use a lymphatic formula, a general parasite\nformula and a parasite formula for microorganisms), endometriosis, ovarian\ncysts and uterine fibroids (adrenal weakness), prolapsed uterus, menorrhagia\n(excessive bleeding, which is estrogen dominance), hot flashes and cramping\n(low thyroid function), edema, under-developed or sagging breasts, dry\nvaginal walls (low estrogen levels), premature births (estrogen dominance),\nlack of tone in the female body, cancers of the female reproductive organs\n(see notes), low sex drive (also underactive thyroid)."
