    "fullText": "System, Urinary System. — System, Urinary System.\nGLANDULAR SYSTEM\n \nSTRUCTURES — The pituitary gland, pineal gland, thyroid and\nparathyroid glands, thymus, adrenal glands, pancreas (Islets of Langerhans),\nglands within the intestinal mucosa, ovaries and testes.\nDIET — A living, raw food diet promotes glandular function. It also helps\nbalance hormone and steroid responses, which in turn increases utilization of\nnutrients. Creates a homeostasis of body chemistry.\nSINGLE HERBS—DETOXIFIERS\nBugleweed Leaf\nDandelion Leaf\nParsley Leaf\nPoke Root\nKelp\nSaw Palmetto Berries\nSINGLE HERBS—STRENGTHENERS\nLicorice Root\nAstragalus Root\nPanax Ginseng Root\nSiberian Ginseng Root\nKelp\nSaw Palmetto Berries\nChaste Tree Berry\nHawthorn Berries\nBugleweed\nDandelion Leaf\nParsley Leaf"
