    "fullText": "ACKNOWLEDGEM ENTS — ACKNOWLEDGEM ENTS \nNo one ever goes it alone.  I thank every courageous spirit who has sought \nout this information and acted upon it.  Thank you.  You deserve the highest \npraise.  \nA special thank you goes out to all the www. sunfood. com staff for your \nsupport, vision, determination and hard work.  \nJohn McCabe, your editing and ideas have made this book sparkle.  \nAngela Hartman and Susan Wildes, you have motivated me to bring this infor-\nmation to millions of people in a format all can understand, use and apply.  \nJavier Michalski, you appeared at the right moment, in the right way, with a \nfantastic plan."
