    "excerpt": "What I have discovered from my experience in the field of the raw-vegetarian \nlifestyle is that the whole question of carnivorism, omnivorism, vegetarianism, \nveganism, raw-foodism and fruitarianism comes down to dietary fat.  Good \nwholesome fat in our foods, not just protein, is essential to good health \nand longevit...",
    "fullText": "io8 I F KARMA — What I have discovered from my experience in the field of the raw-vegetarian \nlifestyle is that the whole question of carnivorism, omnivorism, vegetarianism, \nveganism, raw-foodism and fruitarianism comes down to dietary fat.  Good \nwholesome fat in our foods, not just protein, is essential to good health \nand longevity (as we shall discover in Lesson 11: The Secret Revealed)."
