    "fullText": "148 ORIGINS — ) \nsitions are riddled with irreconcilable gaps, natural selection cannot form a new \nspecies, the fossil record contradicts the darwinian theory, there are no missing \nlinks, etc.  These truths indicate that the theory of evolution is fiawed and pred-\nicated on wrong assumptions.  \nAlong with the elimination of evolutionary philosophies sold to us as facts, \ncollapses a major philosophical basis for humanity's indulgent, disrespectful \nomnivorous and cooked-food diet.  Are we supposed to understand the theory \nof evolution to know how to eat?  Such a proposition is absurd on its face.  Eating \nnaturally is an intuitive knowledge, a natural propensity.  It is easier to sneak up \non lettuce than a rabbit.  Raw plant food stands as the obvious primary food of \nhuman beings.  \nWe arrived on this spinning planet with a design to subsist mostly on raw \nplant food - and that is still our design now."
