    "fullText": "7 66 i DETOXIFICATION — Aside from colon hydrotherapy, you may also speed up the detoxification \nprocess by doing enemas coupled with fasting on lemon and fresh spring water \nor green-leafy vegetable juice.  \nYou alkalinize your body by taking in green-leafy vegetable juices, which \nincrease the blood's electricity.  Electricity increases the solubility of the blood.  The \nmore solubility in the blood, the more undigested and misappropriated minerals it \ncan suspend, remove and metabolize or chelate.  Chlorophyll and the alkaline \nDETOXIFICATION | 767 \ncompounds in green-leafy vegetables combine with heavy metals and foreign \nchemicals in the body to form salts, allowing the body to eliminate them from the \nsystem."
