    "excerpt": "As you lighten the body of obstructions, a joy shall usher forth, such as you \nhave never experienced in your life.  You will laugh for no reason.  \nWhen one radiates health and vitality, one no longer draws on the vitality of \nother humans, animals and plants.  This is due to one's increased energy which \ndiffuses fro...",
    "fullText": "770 I DETOXIFICATION — As you lighten the body of obstructions, a joy shall usher forth, such as you \nhave never experienced in your life.  You will laugh for no reason.  \nWhen one radiates health and vitality, one no longer draws on the vitality of \nother humans, animals and plants.  This is due to one's increased energy which \ndiffuses from areas of greater concentration to areas of lesser concentration.  \nAs energy diffuses, it also creates a magnetism which manifests itself, in the \nform of charisma.  A clean body is charismatic."
