    "excerpt": "I feel, through experience, that I know what the chal-\nlenges are with raw diets, what the solutions are and how we can experience \nthe maximum amount of benefits with insurance for success.  \nKnowledge, we know, rests not upon truth alone, but also upon the under-\nstanding of error.  Genesis 1:29 tells us to eat \"herb...",
    "fullText": "THE SECRET REVEALED — I feel, through experience, that I know what the chal-\nlenges are with raw diets, what the solutions are and how we can experience \nthe maximum amount of benefits with insurance for success.  \nKnowledge, we know, rests not upon truth alone, but also upon the under-\nstanding of error.  Genesis 1:29 tells us to eat \"herbs and fruits\" but it does not \ntell us how much of each or which ones!  I know where the gaps are in the \nknowledge; this book is designed to fill those gaps."
