    "fullText": "ig6 I THE SECRET REVEALED — If the intake of this food is decreased to a pleasant frugal minimum (but \nstill includes high-quality raw plant fats, which are antioxidants), then the \nobstructions and free radicals in the system will be decreased to a minimum.  In \nthis way, the system becomes abundant in electrons, is more efficient (well-\noiled), and operates with less friction, thus maximizing longevity.  \nAnimal Fats \nRaw animal fats are typically saturated, so they are not as strong in their \ncleansing abilities as monounsaturated or polyunsaturated fats, therefore they \ndo not directly help detoxify the body, but certain saturated fats such as lauric \nacid, found in raw milk and butter are helpful as anti-viral agents.  \nAnimal flesh fats are particularly dangerous today, not only because they \nbring some form of karmic energy upon the consumer from the animal's death, \nbut primarily because they contain stored toxins collected from the environ-\nment."
