    "excerpt": "THE SECRET REVEALED \nThree Food Classes and the Effects of Overdose \nSYMPTOMS OF A CHLOROPHYLL OVERDOSE \n• Spaciness.  \n• Laziness.  \n• The feeling of being too passive.  \n• Feelings of being too cold (with the exception \nof wheatgrass juice which can make one feel too hot. ) \nSYMPTOMS OF A SUGAR OVERDOSE \n• Excessive ...",
    "fullText": "THE SECRET REVEALED — THE SECRET REVEALED \nThree Food Classes and the Effects of Overdose \nSYMPTOMS OF A CHLOROPHYLL OVERDOSE \n• Spaciness.  \n• Laziness.  \n• The feeling of being too passive.  \n• Feelings of being too cold (with the exception \nof wheatgrass juice which can make one feel too hot. ) \nSYMPTOMS OF A SUGAR OVERDOSE \n• Excessive urination.  \n• Light-headedness.  \n• Tooth sensitivity.  \n• Edginess.  Anxiety.  \n• Constipation.  \n• Sores in the mouth \n(this can be caused by a potassium overdose: \neat sodium-residue foods, such as celery or kale, \nto help relieve this condition).  \n• Black circles under the eyes (adrenal exhaustion).  \n• Grogginess.  \nSYMPTOMS OF A FAT/OIL OVERDOSE \n• Mucus elimination.  \n• Liver stagnation.  \n• Edginess.  \n• Sluggishness.  \n• Oily pores.  \n• Pimples.  \n• Constipation.  \n• Feelings of being too hot.  \n• Feelings of being \"hung over. \" \n• Strong body odor."
