    "excerpt": "The gorilla \npossesses a fantastic musculature and is capable of bench pressing 4,000 \npounds (more than 1800 kg).  In his wonderful book, L'Homme, Le Singe, Et \nLe Paradis (Humans, Primates, and Paradise), Albert Mosseri describes: \n(Translation) \"The gorilla is not interested in eating so-called protein foods.  \nHow ...",
    "fullText": "250 Ho« — The gorilla \npossesses a fantastic musculature and is capable of bench pressing 4,000 \npounds (more than 1800 kg).  In his wonderful book, L'Homme, Le Singe, Et \nLe Paradis (Humans, Primates, and Paradise), Albert Mosseri describes: \n(Translation) \"The gorilla is not interested in eating so-called protein foods.  \nHow can they develop all that muscle mass, weighing many hundreds of \npounds, eating only green vegetables and fruits?  This fact is of great impor-\ntance."
