    "fullText": "2S& How TO USE THE SUNFOOD TRIANGLE — By stepping in \nat the critical moment and blocking this purge, injected chemical insulin forces \nthe body to live with unacceptable sugars it can hardly tolerate, without being \nable to dismiss them.  \nTo restore a healthy pancreatic condition, find the center in The Sunfood \nTriangle.  Use good sweet fruits (with seeds) to boost the blood sugar when you \nfeel it is dropping.  Fats or protein (green vegetables, spirulina, hemp protein) can \nbe used to thicken the blood if blood sugars rise too quickly."
