    "excerpt": "\" — Dugald Semple, The Sunfood Way To Health \nWe can do five things to cool the body nutritionally: \n1.  Fast.  When you fast, your body temperature lowers.  \n2.  Eat cold, refrigerated, frozen food or ice.  \n3.  Eat only green-leafy vegetables.",
    "fullText": "270 I How TO USE THE SUNFOOD TRIANGLE — \" — Dugald Semple, The Sunfood Way To Health \nWe can do five things to cool the body nutritionally: \n1.  Fast.  When you fast, your body temperature lowers.  \n2.  Eat cold, refrigerated, frozen food or ice.  \n3.  Eat only green-leafy vegetables."
