    "excerpt": "My diet may at first seem limited compared to the standard fast-food diet \ncalled \"moderation,\" but the way I eat is actually filled with great pleasure, \nbecause I have developed the capacity to enjoy the simplest foods and so can \nyou.",
    "fullText": "306 | MY PERSONAL DIET — My diet may at first seem limited compared to the standard fast-food diet \ncalled \"moderation,\" but the way I eat is actually filled with great pleasure, \nbecause I have developed the capacity to enjoy the simplest foods and so can \nyou."
