    "fullText": "340 i SUN — Without this vitamin the bones do not become calcified \nand will bend easily.  This condition is called rickets. \" \nDr.  Kime describes that Sunlight builds the immune system and increases the \noxygenation of the skin.  \nDr.  Kime writes: \nM\nA study of the results of combined Sunlight and exercise, showed that \ngroup that was getting the Sunlight treatments with exercise, had improved \nalmost twice as much as shown by their electrocardiograms, as had those \nwho only exercised, even though both groups were on a general health \nresort treatment program. \" \nSunlight lowers blood sugar.  It is a natural insulin.  A diet high in sweet fruit \nmust also be accompanied by Sunshine on the skin to help metabolize the \nsugar."
