    "fullText": "408 THE MYSTERY OF SEX TRANSMUTATION — The books and articles I have read on diet, spirituality and sex generally agree \nthat between 25% and 40% of the life-force energy men accumulate from \nbreathing, eating, Sunlight, spiritual power, etc.  is transmuted into sexual energy, \nwhich is stored physically in male sperm.  A single ejaculation contains 200 to \n500 million sperm cells.  If we consider each sperm cell as a potential human \nbeing, there are sufficient sperm cells for a man in a few days to generate the \ncurrent population of the Earth.  That is the power of semen.  \nComplementary to dietary considerations, there is a Taoist technique for redi-\nrection of the sexual energy called the \"big draw. \" This technique involves \ndrawing back the discharge of sexual energy and redirecting it up the spine to \nthe brain by drawing in the breath at the moment one is nearing sexual climax.  \nThrough practice one can develop this retention ability."
