    "fullText": "408 THE MYSTERY OF SEX TRANSMUTATION — The increase in sexual \npotency that follows is quite remarkable in that it creates great libido, more \nsubtle sexual enjoyment, remarkable capacity and progressively increasing \nsensitivity.  \nFor men, the point is to have sex, but not to ejaculate every time.  Sex is essen-\ntial to excellent health as it restores imbalances in the body chemistry, excites \nthe sex hormones and balances the other major glands (the adrenal, thymus, \nthyroid, pituitary, hypothalamus, and pineal).  Sex clears the mind, frees the spirit \nand helps build a wonderful relationship with one's partner."
