    "excerpt": "Optimally, I think it is excellent to \nmove around the fat category eating macadamia nuts for several weeks, then \nolives for several months, eating some avocados, bringing in some durian, then \npecans.  This is how I have come to eat raw plant fats.  This gives your body some \nvariety and makes your diet easier on the...",
    "fullText": "The favorite food of raw-foodists all over the world: — Optimally, I think it is excellent to \nmove around the fat category eating macadamia nuts for several weeks, then \nolives for several months, eating some avocados, bringing in some durian, then \npecans.  This is how I have come to eat raw plant fats.  This gives your body some \nvariety and makes your diet easier on the digestive organs, especially the liver."
