    "fullText": "474 A MESSAGE TO ALL SUNFOODISTS — Let it dry another's tears, \nUntil in heaven the deed appears, \nPlease pass it on.  \nI want you to know that I feel tremendously fortunate to be the individual to \nbring this blessing to you.  It seems almost uncanny that such an opportunity \nwould be entrusted upon me.  I would like to thank you for your interest in \nbecoming all that you can possibly be.  \nTogether we must carry the Sunfood Diet message forward.  Together we can \nturn this world into a paradise.  You, who have glimpsed your true potential, will \nbe among the leaders of a new dispensation on Earth.  \nA MESSAGE TO ALL SUNFOODISTS \n\"WE, THE NEW, THE NAMELESS, THE HARD-TO-UNDERSTAND, WE \nFIRSTLINGS OF A YET UNTRIED FUTURE — WE REQUIRE FOR A NEW \nEND ALSO A NEW MEANS, NAMELY, A NEW HEALTHINESS, \nSTRONGER, SHARPER, TOUGHER, BOLDER, AND MERRIER THAN \nANY HEALTHINESS HITHERTO."
