    "excerpt": "486 SELECTED POLICY \nAction. Life. Manifestation. \nYou are a — \nPerfect Creation. \nTrust the spirit, desire it too. \nYe are Cods! I tell you! \nTransmit the signal, \nHarmonize the storm \nThe Ascended Masters \nAre here in form. \nAbundant love \nYou attract. \nAbundant health, \nNo turning back; \nAbundant life \nIt's a game, ...",
    "fullText": "486 SELECTED POLICY — 486 SELECTED POLICY \nAction. Life. Manifestation. \nYou are a — \nPerfect Creation. \nTrust the spirit, desire it too. \nYe are Cods! I tell you! \nTransmit the signal, \nHarmonize the storm \nThe Ascended Masters \nAre here in form. \nAbundant love \nYou attract. \nAbundant health, \nNo turning back; \nAbundant life \nIt's a game, you see, \nAbundant world \nFulfill your Destiny. \nThe Ascended Ones shower you; \nTheir vibration soon to strengthen you! \nThey seed your creative fire, \nIt's reality as you desire. \nSELECTED POETRY | 4S7 \nBe extremely quiet \nHave no diet \nAnd create, \nGather your spirit \nEmanate: \nThe master work, \nThe philosopher's stone, \nThe elixir of life, \nFew have known. \nMaterialized before you, \nThe mysterious, secret chain, \nThe Cosmic Circuit Board \nConnecting every plane. \nThe white powder of gold \nWhat Enoch left untold. \nAscended Master \nImpeccable Faster \nYou are Creators upon this plane. \nThe NeFiLim \nAre upon the Earth. \nThis is the moment \nOf your rebirth."
