    "excerpt": "530 ALL-RAW WEEKLY MENU \nQuantities On The All-Raw Diet \nFeel free to eat large quantities of raw fruits and vegetables if you desire.  Most \nof you will eat less than I recommend here in these menu plans, hcwever, I want \nyou to feel free to enjoy abundant natural foods.  Over time you can refine your \ndiet, increase ...",
    "fullText": "530 ALL-RAW WEEKLY MENU — 530 ALL-RAW WEEKLY MENU \nQuantities On The All-Raw Diet \nFeel free to eat large quantities of raw fruits and vegetables if you desire.  Most \nof you will eat less than I recommend here in these menu plans, hcwever, I want \nyou to feel free to enjoy abundant natural foods.  Over time you can refine your \ndiet, increase your assimilation, enjoy a liquid diet more often and eat less and \nless.  Follow the guidelines laid out in The Sunfood Triangle.  Natural raw nutri-\ntion coupled with daily exercise is the foundation of perfect health.  The All-Raw \nMenu is designed for an active 145-175 pound (66-80 kg) individual.  Those of \na lighter weight and/or who are less active can adjust the quantities down \naccordingly.  \nWomen, suggested daily maximum intake: \n6 pounds (2. 7 kg) of fruit \n2. 5 pounds (1. 1 kg) of vegetables (one-third in salad, two-thirds in juice) \n0. 25 pounds (0. 11 kg) of nuts or seeds \nMen, suggested daily maximum intake: \n7. 5 pounds (3. 6 kg) of fruit \n3 pounds (1."
