    "excerpt": "53« \nThere are so many options for designing beautiful meals with raw plant foods.  \nBring in two or more raw-food recipe books to enhance your kitchen.  Our \norganization, www. sunfood. com, now distributes every high-quality raw-food \nrecipe book available in the world today (a goal I set in the summer of 1995).  \nTh...",
    "fullText": "There are so many options for designing beautiful meals with raw plant foods. — 53« \nThere are so many options for designing beautiful meals with raw plant foods.  \nBring in two or more raw-food recipe books to enhance your kitchen.  Our \norganization, www. sunfood. com, now distributes every high-quality raw-food \nrecipe book available in the world today (a goal I set in the summer of 1995).  \nThe companion recipe books to this work such as Raw Food Real World or \nThe LifeFood Recipe Book contain a wide variety of recipe ideas and combi-\nnations, which reiterate and expand on the ideas in this book.  \nI do have a wonderful secret to share with all prospective live-food chefs.  It \nwould seem that the most ideal foods for human consumption would contain all \nthree food classes simultaneously (review Lesson 11: The Secret Revealed).  \nSince this does not occur, the secret to making totally satisfying live-food \nrecipes is to combine all three categories of food (sugar, fat and chlorophyll) into \none meal.  \nOne of the most famous raw-food recipes is Dr."
