    "excerpt": "These are essential household appli-\nances to create a healthy future for \nyou and your family.  For more informa-\ntion on these appliances, please visit \nwww. sunfood. com.  \nRECIPES \nAvocado Burritos \n8 leaves of romaine lettuce \n2 avocados \n2 jalapeno peppers \n4 tomatoes \n1 orange \nMix and mash the avocados, peppers...",
    "fullText": "There are so many options for designing beautiful meals with raw plant foods. — These are essential household appli-\nances to create a healthy future for \nyou and your family.  For more informa-\ntion on these appliances, please visit \nwww. sunfood. com.  \nRECIPES \nAvocado Burritos \n8 leaves of romaine lettuce \n2 avocados \n2 jalapeno peppers \n4 tomatoes \n1 orange \nMix and mash the avocados, peppers \nand tomatoes.  Squeeze on the \norange for sweetness.  Place avocado \nmix into a lettuce leaf and roll up.  \nRemove the jalapeno peppers if \nserving this dish to young children."
