    "excerpt": "RAW FOOD \nRESTAURANTS \nARIZONA \nTREE OF LIFE \n771 Harshaw Road \nPatagonia, AZ 85624 \n520-394-2589 \nwww. treeoflife. nu \nThe Tree Of Life Rejuvenation Center \nhas a raw-food restaurant open to the \npublic.  Fresh foods directly from the \ngarden are served in a delightful \noutdoor setting connected with \nnature.  Patagon...",
    "fullText": "RAW FOOD — RAW FOOD \nRESTAURANTS \nARIZONA \nTREE OF LIFE \n771 Harshaw Road \nPatagonia, AZ 85624 \n520-394-2589 \nwww. treeoflife. nu \nThe Tree Of Life Rejuvenation Center \nhas a raw-food restaurant open to the \npublic.  Fresh foods directly from the \ngarden are served in a delightful \noutdoor setting connected with \nnature.  Patagonia is approximately \none hour south of Tucson.  \nRAWESOME CAFE \n(inside Gentle Strength Co-op) \nnear the corner of University & Ash \nTempe, Arizona \nContact: Charlie Mort. Jim \n480-496-5959 \ninfo@rawforlife. com \nwww. rawforlife. com \nThe Rawesome Cafe is on a mission \nto make raw-food cuisine more acces-\nsible by providing a central meeting \nplace for like-minded individuals to \ngather.  \nCALIFORNIA \nALIVE!  \n1972 Lombard Street \nSan Francisco, CA 94123 \n415-923-1052 \naliveveggie@sbcglobal. net \nA quaint raw-food restaurant to \nserve the growing need for delicious \nhealthy dining experiences in the \nBay Area."
