    "fullText": "RAW FOOD — Au LAC \nGourmet Vegetarian Restaurant \nincluding Four-Course Organic \nRaw Vegan Dinner \n16563 Brookhurst Street \nFountain Valley, CA 92708 \n714-418-0658 \nwww. aulac. com \nChef Ito of Au Lac presents fantastic \ngourmet raw delights that carry the \nlove and beauty that he emanates.  Au \nLac's raw dessert menu is reason \nalone to visit.  Highly recommended.  \nYou can feel the love in the food.  \nCAFE GRATITUDE \n2400 Harrison Street \nSan Francisco, CA \n(415) 824-4652 \nwww. withthecurrent. com/cafe. htm \nCafe Gratitude is a pure expression of \na world of plenty.  The food and \npeople are a celebration of aliveness.  \nThey only select the finest organic \ningredients to honor the earth and \nourselves.  They support local \nfarmers, sustainable agriculture and \nenvironmentally friendly products.  \nTheir food is prepared with love."
