    "excerpt": "\" — David Wolfe \nGREEN LIFE EVOLUTION CENTER \n410 Railroad Ave \nBlue Lake, CA 95525 \n707-668-1781 \nThe Green Life Evolution Center is a \nnew enclave for those seeking \ncommunity, raw food lifestyle support \nand education in Northern California.  \nGreen Life is a market which focuses \non prepared food items, dessert, \nj...",
    "fullText": "are invited to step inside and enjoy — \" — David Wolfe \nGREEN LIFE EVOLUTION CENTER \n410 Railroad Ave \nBlue Lake, CA 95525 \n707-668-1781 \nThe Green Life Evolution Center is a \nnew enclave for those seeking \ncommunity, raw food lifestyle support \nand education in Northern California.  \nGreen Life is a market which focuses \non prepared food items, dessert, \njuices and smoothies.  They are in the \nprocess of transitioning into a full \nservice raw cafe.  They also feature the \nwares of local artisans.  \nGOOD MOOD FOOD DELI CAFE \n5930 Warner Avenue \nHuntington Beach, CA \n714-377-2028 \nwww. goodmoodfood. com \nrentachef@goodmoodfood. com \nThis cafe offers Southern-California-\nstyle raw-food cuisine with a hint of \nGerman influence brought in by the \nowners.  A wonderful place offering a \ngreat service to the community.  \nJADE CAFE \n1521 Griffith Park Blvd."
