    "excerpt": "Angeles restaurant, where anything \ngoes...  as long as it's RAW!  This is \ntruly an experience of gourmet living-\nfood cuisine.  \nKUNG FOOD \n2949 5th Avenue \nSan Diego, CA 92103 \nContacts: Mitch or Brad \n619-298-7302 \nFax: 619-298-1559 \nwww. kung-food. com \nAn organic restaurant in the Hillcrest \ncommunity just west o...",
    "fullText": "Angeles restaurant, where anything — Angeles restaurant, where anything \ngoes...  as long as it's RAW!  This is \ntruly an experience of gourmet living-\nfood cuisine.  \nKUNG FOOD \n2949 5th Avenue \nSan Diego, CA 92103 \nContacts: Mitch or Brad \n619-298-7302 \nFax: 619-298-1559 \nwww. kung-food. com \nAn organic restaurant in the Hillcrest \ncommunity just west of Balboa Park \nin San Diego.  Kung Food offers 100% \nplant-based organic, love-filled food, \na full juice bar and raw specialties \n(raw salad bar, soup, deli specialties \nand desserts).  Open seven days a \nweek: Mon-Thurs: n am to 10 pm.  \nFriday: n am to Midnight, Saturday: \n9am to Midnight and Sunday: 9am to \n10pm.  An organic drive-thru option \nis available Monday thru Friday!  After \n7 pm, Kung Food hosts regular enter-\ntainment.  \nLEAF CUISINE \n11938 West Washington Blvd.  \nLos Angeles, CA 90066 \n310-390-6005 \nFax: 310-390-5720 \ninfo@leafcuisine. com \nLeaf Cuisine is a new raw-food restau-\nrant in the LA area serving LA's \ngrowing raw-food movement."
