    "fullText": "Angeles restaurant, where anything — net \nA great place for a quick snack or \njuice for all those in the San \nFrancisco Bay Area.  \nTASTE OF THE GODDESS \n7253 Santa Monica Boulevard \nWest Hollywood, CA 90046 \n323-874-7700 \nContact: Jenny \nwww. tasteofthegoddess. com \nHours of Operation \nMon-Thurs: 11-7 pm \nFriday & Saturdays: 12-9 pm \nTaste of the Goddess Cafe is an \norganic living foods cafe.  They have \nsmoothies, entrees, Goddess salads \nand desserts.  They have front and \nback patio seating and some parking \nis available.  \nCOLORADO \nTURTLE LAKE REFUGE \n826 East 3rd Avenue \nDurango, CO 81301 \n(970) 247-8395 \nContact: Katrina \nwww. turtlelakerefuge. org \nturtlelakerefuge@yahoo. com \nTurtle Lake Refuge is all heart and \nsoul.  A wonderful sanctuary nestled \nin the quiet city of Durango.  Call and \nfind out when you can stop in for one \nof their live-food meals.  \nFLORIDA \n5TH AVENUE CAFÉ AND MARKET \nn6 E.  Fifth Avenue \nMount Dora, FL 32757 \n352-383-0090 \nContact: Tesha Bananda \nwww. 5thavenuecafe."
