    "excerpt": "LUSH LIFE CAFE \n1405 Ralph D.  Abernathy Blvd.  \nAtlanta, Georgia 30310 \n404-758-8737 \nwww. fyicomminc. com/lushlifecafe \nLush Life Cafe pays close attention to \nquality details.  Lush Life is an exclu-\nsively vegan restaurant, offering a \nnumber of live-food items.  They are \ncontinually expanding on their live-\nfood ...",
    "fullText": "LUSH LIFE CAFE — LUSH LIFE CAFE \n1405 Ralph D.  Abernathy Blvd.  \nAtlanta, Georgia 30310 \n404-758-8737 \nwww. fyicomminc. com/lushlifecafe \nLush Life Cafe pays close attention to \nquality details.  Lush Life is an exclu-\nsively vegan restaurant, offering a \nnumber of live-food items.  They are \ncontinually expanding on their live-\nfood menu.  \nEVERLASTING LIFE \n87 Ralph D.  Abernathy Blvd SW \nAtlanta, Georgia 30310 \n404-758-1 no \nThe Center for Everlasting Life is a \ngrocery store, which also offers raw-\nfood selections.  They have two other \nlocations: one in Maryland and in DC.  \nCAFE\" LIFE \n1453 Roswell Road \nMarietta, GA 30062 \n770-977-9583 \nwww.  I i feg roce ry.  co m \nFreshly-prepared, organic, vegan and \nliving foods are served here.  This cafe \nboasts an organic salad bar and juice \nbar.  Many healthy options are avail-\nable for special diets.  Dine in or take \nout.  This cafe is located inside Life \nGrocery Natural Foods Co-op Market."
