    "excerpt": "MINNESOTA \nECOPOLITAN \n2409 Lyndale Ave.  South \nMinneapolis, MN 55405 \n612-87-GREEN (47336) \ninfo@ecopolitan. net \nwww. ecopolitan. net \nEcopolitan is a completely organic, \nvegan and raw restaurant as well as \nan ecological shop selling natural, \nnon-toxic home and body goods.  \nNEVADA \nGo RAW CAFÉ \n2910 Lake East Dr...",
    "fullText": "LUSH LIFE CAFE — MINNESOTA \nECOPOLITAN \n2409 Lyndale Ave.  South \nMinneapolis, MN 55405 \n612-87-GREEN (47336) \ninfo@ecopolitan. net \nwww. ecopolitan. net \nEcopolitan is a completely organic, \nvegan and raw restaurant as well as \nan ecological shop selling natural, \nnon-toxic home and body goods.  \nNEVADA \nGo RAW CAFÉ \n2910 Lake East Drive \nLas Vegas, NV 89117 \nwww. gorawcafe. com \nPhone/Fax: 702. 254. 5382 \nThis is the first raw restaurant in the \ndynamic duo.  \nGo RAW CAFÉ (2) \n2381 East Windmill Way \nLas Vegas, NV 89123 \nwww. gorawcafe. com \nThis is a great pair of raw-food restau-\nrants serving the Las Vegas area.  The \nfood is fantastic and the love is there!  \nVisit both restaurants and experience \nthe true delight of raw-food cuisine.  \nHighly recommended!  \nNEW JERSEY \nDOWN TO EARTH \n7 Broad Street \nRedbank, NJ 07701 \n732-747-4542 \nNow the residents of the Garden State \ncan enjoy the fruits of the garden at \nthis vegan-organic restaurant.  Each day \nthey feature a raw-live food special."
