    "excerpt": "EAST COAST VEGAN RESTAURANT \n313-A W.  Water Street \nToms River, NJ 08753 \n732-473-9555 \nwww. eastcoastvegan. com \nSome live-food is found on the menu \nin this small town where David Wolfe \nwas born!  \nNEW YORK \nBLUE GREEN \nOrganic Juice Cafe \n248 Mott St.  \nNew York, NY 10012 \nor \n203 East 74th St.  \nNew York, NY 1002...",
