    "excerpt": "IN THE RAW \n65 Tinker Street \nWoodstock, New York 12498 \n845-679-9494 \nUpstate New York's first raw-food deli \nin scenic Woodstock NY!  A quaint \nslice of paradise!  \nPENNSYVANIA \nARNOLD'S WAY \n319 West Main St.  \nStore 4 Rear \nLansdale, PA 19446 \n215-361-0116 \nwww. arnoldsway. com \nArnold's Way offers raw-food meals \n...",
    "fullText": "EAST COAST VEGAN RESTAURANT — IN THE RAW \n65 Tinker Street \nWoodstock, New York 12498 \n845-679-9494 \nUpstate New York's first raw-food deli \nin scenic Woodstock NY!  A quaint \nslice of paradise!  \nPENNSYVANIA \nARNOLD'S WAY \n319 West Main St.  \nStore 4 Rear \nLansdale, PA 19446 \n215-361-0116 \nwww. arnoldsway. com \nArnold's Way offers raw-food meals \nand juices.  A quaint, wonderful, \neducational restaurant located near \nPhiladelphia.  \nRAW LIFE LINE \nHuntingdon Valley, PA \nContact: Joel Odhner \n800-RAW-9197 \n215-947-1510 \njoel@rawlifeline. com \nwww. rawlifeline. com \nA great source for raw meals shipped \nright to your door!  All meals are indi-\nvidually packaged, labeled with \ningredients and serving suggestions.  \nEach order is packed in a cooler box \nwith dry ice for ultimate temperature \ncontrol and sent to your door!  All \nmeals are guaranteed to your satis-\nfaction.  Check out the web site and \nfind wonderful recipes, order meals, \nraw food products and more!"
