    "fullText": "580 HEALING RETREATS — Contact is via e-mail only.  \nHEALING RETREATS j 581 \nSPIRIT OF THE EARTH \n5871 Bells Rd \nLondon, Ontario, N6P 1P3 \nCanada \n519-652-9109 \nCanadian directors Walter and \nLorenna host week to month-long \nretreats in sunny Costa Rica; the \nfocus is on raw food and transforma-\ntion in a tropical jungle setting.  \nPACHA MAMA \n506-289-7081 \nFax: 506-228-5173 \npachamama@tyohar. org \nwww. pacha-mama. org \nPacha Mama is a vegetarian, raw-\nfood-oriented community and healing \nplace nestled in the hills of the \nWestern slopes of the Nicoya penin-\nsula in Costa Rica.  The community \nand land exude healing, paradise \nconsciousness and beauty in all its \nfinest forms.  Many healers are here.  \nDifferent healing programs and \nretreats are offered by Pacha Mama.  \nPlease visit the website for updates \nand information.  \nENGLAND \nDETOX YOUR WORLD RETREATS \nCambridgeshire, England, UK \nTelephone: +44 (0)8700 113 119 \nFax: +44 (0)8700 114 119 \nContact: Shazzie \nsales@detoxyourworld. com \nwww."
