    "excerpt": "detoxyourworld. com \nThis one-on-one exclusive retreat situ-\nation allows you to find yourself \nagain.  On your holistic two to five-day \nretreat, you will be pampered, re-\neducated, and loved into making the \nchanges you've always wanted.  All \nretreats include high-quality living \nfood prep classes, massages, detox \n...",
    "fullText": "580 HEALING RETREATS — detoxyourworld. com \nThis one-on-one exclusive retreat situ-\nation allows you to find yourself \nagain.  On your holistic two to five-day \nretreat, you will be pampered, re-\neducated, and loved into making the \nchanges you've always wanted.  All \nretreats include high-quality living \nfood prep classes, massages, detox \ntreatments, exercise and meditations.  \nYou even take home a Detox Box and \nFact File so you can continue the \ngood work you started.  \nMEXICO \nSANOVIV MEDICAL INSTITUTE \n(in beautiful Baja, California, Mexico) \n2602-C Transportation Avenue \nNational City, CA 91950 \n800-SANOVIV (726-6848) \nFax: 801-954-7666 \nwww. sanoviv. com \nSanoviv is a fantastic hospital that \noffers living-food cuisine, in beautiful \nBaja California, Mexico.  The facility \nhas extraordinary quality standards \nand offers the latest healing technolo-\ngies.  The hospital is located within a \none hour drive from San Diego, \nCalifornia.  Transportation to Sanoviv \nfrom the United States is offered."
