    "fullText": "6o6 i THE FRUIT TREE PLANTING FOUNDATION — org and \nfollow the instructions to donate online or you may send check or money order \nmade payable to: \nTHE FRUIT TREE PLANTING FOUNDATION \nWWW. FTPF. ORG \nPO Box 900113 \nSan Diego, CA 92190 \nUSA \nDonations of any amount are accepted.  Consider donating anywhere from $5 \nto $5,000.  Please visit our website: www. ftpf. org \nFor your tax records, our registered non-profit organization will send you a \nconfirmation that we received your tax-deductible donation.  \n\"IN SPITE OF EVERYTHING, HUMANITY IS ADMIRABLE. \" \n— jean Giono, author of The Man Who Planted Trees \n\"WHEN YOU EAT A FRUIT, THANK THE PERSON WHO PLANTED THE TREE. \" \n— VIETNAMESE PROVERB.  \nTHEBESTDAYEVER. COM | 607 \nDavid Wolfe's Peak Performance Archives available at this new website: \nw w w. th e bestday e ve r. co m \n(Warning!  The contents of this website may cause you to have The Best Day Ever!"
