    "excerpt": "608 | THEBESTDAYEVER. COM \nThis incredible website gives you complete ACCESS to my text, audio and \nvideo library containing dozens ot lectures and CONFIDENTIAL files on nutri-\ntion, health, minerals, rejuvenation programs and exotic information.  Including \ninformation on how to heal some of the most stubborn conditio...",
    "fullText": "608 | THEBESTDAYEVER.COM — 608 | THEBESTDAYEVER. COM \nThis incredible website gives you complete ACCESS to my text, audio and \nvideo library containing dozens ot lectures and CONFIDENTIAL files on nutri-\ntion, health, minerals, rejuvenation programs and exotic information.  Including \ninformation on how to heal some of the most stubborn conditiors known to \nhumanity.  \nAlso, the website includes professional nutrition coaching forums where you \ncan get up-to-the-moment answers to your questions.  You will also hear live \ninterviews with me on a monthly basis, where I answer your questions and bring \nyou up to date on the latest and greatest.  Also, if you are interested, you can tap \ninto my monthly diary blog.  \nI am a BIG believer in saturating oneself with positive, empowering informa-\ntion.  www. thebestdayever. com has been designed to literally bombard you with \ninspirational text, audio and video."
