    "excerpt": "Much of the material on the site you can \ndownload directly onto your computer or iPod and use whenever you want!  \nwww. thebestdayever. com is essentially my uncensored online magazine that \nallows you to instantly access the latest, most fascinating information in the \nfield.  No more waiting by the mailbox.  All I d...",
    "fullText": "608 | THEBESTDAYEVER.COM — Much of the material on the site you can \ndownload directly onto your computer or iPod and use whenever you want!  \nwww. thebestdayever. com is essentially my uncensored online magazine that \nallows you to instantly access the latest, most fascinating information in the \nfield.  No more waiting by the mailbox.  All I do, all day, every day is pursue and \nlive the cutting edge of health, beauty, nutrition, peak performance, vegetarian \ndiets and especially raw-food diets.  This information allows you to leap miles \nahead of the curve and create astounding rejuvenation and healing now without \nhaving to make the same mistakes tens of thousands of others have made.  \nWhy am I doing this?  Because the information that is in my brain and \ncomputer is expanding far faster than I can publish it in books.  I have been \nperplexed as to what to do with it all.  Eventually, the answer appeared: create \nan online magazine for you!"
