    "excerpt": "612 | ABOUT THE AUTHOR \nAs part of his action-packed schedule, David also coaches and feeds \nHollywood producers and celebrities as well as some of the world's leading \nbusiness people.  David is currently completing several new books, and occa-\nsionally plays drums for the raw rock and roll group - The Healing Waters ...",
    "fullText": "612 | ABOUT THE AUTHOR — 612 | ABOUT THE AUTHOR \nAs part of his action-packed schedule, David also coaches and feeds \nHollywood producers and celebrities as well as some of the world's leading \nbusiness people.  David is currently completing several new books, and occa-\nsionally plays drums for the raw rock and roll group - The Healing Waters Band \n(www. thehealingwatersband. com).  \nIn 2004, David starred as \"Avocado\" in the reality television show Mad Mad \nHouse airing on the Science Fiction Channel.  \nOther than a passion for raw-food nutrition and music, David's favorite \nhobbies include: hiking, yoga, literature, writing, alchemy, chemistry, nature \nadventures, hot springing, planting fruit trees, spending time with loved ones \nand having The Best Day Ever!  \nTo contact David or book him on a television or radio show, for an interview \nor for a seminar please contact: \nwww. sunfood. com \n888-RAW-FOOD \nInternational: +001-619-596-7979 \nFax: 619-596-7997 \nnature@sunfood. com \nWebsites: \nwww. sunfood."
