    "fullText": "612 | ABOUT THE AUTHOR — com \nwww. davidwolfe. com \nwww. thebestdayever. com \nwww. ftpf. org \nwww. thehealingwatersband. com \nADDITIONAL COPIES OF THE SUNFOOD DIET | 613 \nAdditional Copies of The Sunfood Diet Success System \nAdditional copies of The Sunfood Diet Success System may be ordered \ndirectly from www. sunfood. com.  Bulk discounts are available.  Shipping prices \nare subject to change over time.  \nIf you enjoyed The Sunfood Diet Success System, please order your copy of \nSunfood Living: Resource Guide for Global Health.  Sunfood Living is the \ncompanion book to The Sunfood Diet.  Sunfood Living is an outstanding 562 \npage resource that is not only educational, but also acts as your guide as you \nperuse the Internet looking for new friends, eco-friendly companies, innovative \nproducts, sustainable home technologies, and much, much more.  You may order \none or more copies of Sunfood Living directly from www. sunfood. com."
