    "fullText": "612 | ABOUT THE AUTHOR — If you have any questions or comments about any of the material contained \nin this book, feel free to write, call, or e-mail www. sunfood. com.  \nAlso, please review our online catalog and community at www. sunfood. com.  \nwww. sunfood. com distributes the highest-quality bulk organic Raw Foods, \nRaw Superfoods, Exotic Foods, Raw Food & Raw Recipe Books, Juicers, \nBlenders, Dehydrators, Special Supplements, and much more to help assist, \nmaintain, and enjoy a raw plant-food-based, environmentally-friendly lifestyle.  \nTo receive free, exclusive e-mail bulletins (concerning upcoming events, David \nWolfe seminars, new products, exciting news, media coverage, etc. ) from \nwww. sunfood. com and David Wolfe, simply send an e-mail to: \nnature@sunfood. com requesting to be added to the subscriber list.  \nwww. sunfood. com \nMailing Address: PO Box 900202, San Diego, CA 92190 USA \n(800) 205-2350 \n(888) 729-3663 \nInternational: +001-619-596-7979 \nFax:619-596-7997 \nnature@sunfood."
