    "excerpt": "Professor Ehret did not invent or\noriginate fasting or the use of fruit and green-leaf\nvegetables in improved diet, as these were recog-\nnized factors, but he did bring the greatest efficien-\ncy in their use by originating an entirely new\nsystem of combining them as a systematic healing\nmethod, under the name of The Mu...",
