    "fullText": "INTRODUCTION — The mucusless diet\nhealing system has been exhaustively tested by the\nthousands of cures by Professor Ehret and his\ndisciples (the Ehretists) of Europe and the West;\nespecially in advising the procedure in thousands of\ncases, most of them pronounced \"incurable. \"\nThese have consisted of paralysis, epilepsy, blind-\nness, diabetes, turberculosis, etc. \n\"The school in which I acquired the knowledge\nand graduated from,\" said the originator of the\nnew system, \"was in curing my own case of\nBright's disease."
