    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — 22\nRATIONAL FASTING\nwith great delight. It certainly is the best both\nfrom a practical and scientifically sound point of\nview. I really wished I had the financial means to\npublish your book and distribute it by the mil-\nlions.\"\nThere is a disconcerting indication that fasting will\nbecome nothing hut a fad. Hopefully, my cure will\nbe spared that fate and gradually establish itself in\na permanent first place to the benefit of all people.\nLocarno, Summer 1914.\nARNOLD EHRET.\nPDF compression, OCR, web optimization using a watermarked evaluation copy of CVISION PDFCompressor"
