    "excerpt": "It is my duty and\nmoral obligation to perpetuate the truth which I\nhave experienced on my own body and which will\nserve the healthy to remain strong and not to fall\nprey to disease and sickness. \nNowadays there are two ways for sick people to\ncombat their illness.  There is the one kind of sick\nwho want to get it over ...",
    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — It is my duty and\nmoral obligation to perpetuate the truth which I\nhave experienced on my own body and which will\nserve the healthy to remain strong and not to fall\nprey to disease and sickness. \nNowadays there are two ways for sick people to\ncombat their illness.  There is the one kind of sick\nwho want to get it over and done with as soon as\npossible.  They take pills, drugs, vaccines etc.  and\nindeed these medications will help to restore their\nhealth for a while.  However a complete cure\nbecomes less likely in the long run and eventually a\nrenewed and more severe breakdown of the system\nis unavoidable."
