    "excerpt": "I even maintain that he lived\nin absolute health, beauty and strength without\npain and grief just the way the Bible says. Fruit\nalone, the sole mucusless food, is natural.  Every-\nthing prepared by man, or supposedly improved by\nhim, is evil.  The evidence regarding fruit is scientif-\nically proven; the apple or banana...",
    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — I even maintain that he lived\nin absolute health, beauty and strength without\npain and grief just the way the Bible says. Fruit\nalone, the sole mucusless food, is natural.  Every-\nthing prepared by man, or supposedly improved by\nhim, is evil.  The evidence regarding fruit is scientif-\nically proven; the apple or banana for instance\ncontain everything that man needs.  Man is\nso\nperfect that he can live on only one kind of fruit\nfor at least quite some time."
