    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — ous: meat, alcohol, coffee and tobacco are by\ncomparison rather harmless in the long run AS\nLONG AS THEY ARE CONSUMED WITH MOD-\nERATION. \nIn order to avoid misunderstanding on the part of\nteetotalers and vegetarians,\nI must insert a few\nexplanations here.  Meat is not a food, it is only a\nstimulant which ferments and decays in the stom-\nach.  The process of decay, however, does not begin\nin the stomach, it sets in right after the slaughter-\ning of the animal.  Such are Prof.  Dr.  S."
