    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — 62\nRATIONAL FASTING\nnormal situation, but alas, the exception, the dis-\nease, has become the rule today. \nIf everybody lived only on mucusless food from his\nearliest youth and ate nothing but fruit, it would\nstand to reason that he could grow neither old nor\nsick.  I have seen people who became so rejuvenated\nand beautiful after a mucusless diet cure that I\nalmost didn't recognize them.  For thousands of\nyears humanity has indulged in dreams and wishful\nthinking about the fountain of youth and has been\nlooking for it in the stars. \nJust think of the amount of money spent on\nremedies for impotence and sterility, of course all\nin vain.  And yet, it could be so easy to give help at\nleast to some people simply by putting them on a\nbetter healthier diet. \nWe can hardly imagine the beauty and strength\nwith which the paradisiacal 'godlike' man was\nendowed, what kind of wonderful, strong and clear\nvoice he had!"
