    "excerpt": "One of the amazing results of my\ncure is a remarkable improvement in the voice, a\nstrengthening of the vocal cords.  Even a lost voice\ncan be reactivated which is eloquent proof indeed\nof the far reaching effects of my system on the\nentire human organism.  I wish to refer here espe-\ncially to the tremendous success tha...",
    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — One of the amazing results of my\ncure is a remarkable improvement in the voice, a\nstrengthening of the vocal cords.  Even a lost voice\ncan be reactivated which is eloquent proof indeed\nof the far reaching effects of my system on the\nentire human organism.  I wish to refer here espe-\ncially to the tremendous success that the Royal\nBavarian Chamber Singer Heinrich Knote, Munich,\nachieved through a cure under my direction.  His\nvoice improved in clarity and beauty to such an\nextent that the entire musical world was amazed\nand full of the highest praise."
