    "fullText": "INCREASING LONGEVITY — INCREASING LONGEVITY\n65\nmucus building up in the body, a sign of gradual\ndisintegration.\nThe death struggle is only the last effort of the\norganism to excrete mucus, a last fight of the still\nliving cells against the dead ones and their deathly\npoisons. If the white dead cells, i.e. the mucus in\nthe blood, gain the upper hand, clogging up of the\nblood vessels of the heart occurs. At the same time\na chemical transformation, a sudden poisoning of\nthe entire blood supply system takes place and\ndeath takes its toll.\nPDF compression, OCR, web optimization using a watermarked evaluation copy of CVISION PDFCompressor"
