    "excerpt": "It is a\nwell known fact that a faster can feel better and is\nactually stronger on the twentieth day of his fast\nthan on the fifth or sixth day.  Certainly ample\nproof that vitality does not depend primarily on\nfood but rather on an unobstructed circulation. \n(See Lesson 5 of my Mucusless Diet Healing Sys-\ntem).  The sm...",
    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — It is a\nwell known fact that a faster can feel better and is\nactually stronger on the twentieth day of his fast\nthan on the fifth or sixth day.  Certainly ample\nproof that vitality does not depend primarily on\nfood but rather on an unobstructed circulation. \n(See Lesson 5 of my Mucusless Diet Healing Sys-\ntem).  The smaller the amount of obstruction the\ngreater the air pressure and consequently more\nvitality. \nThe above explanations will have given you an\ninsight into the nature of a fasting cure.  At first it\nis a negative proposition to relieve the body of\ndirect obstruction by abstaining from solid foods."
