    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — In fact,\nthe waste products of meat, fatty plaque-shaped\nparticles, are deposited on the walls of the blood\nvessels where in time they form a thick lining,\ncalcify and thus contribute to the hardening of the\narteries.  This hardening of the arteries, in many\ncases resulting in high blood pressure, is the chief\ncause of heart attacks and diseases of senility.  Tests\non animals have already shown that meat-eating\nanimals will die if fed on cooked meat alone.  And\nrats soon die if kept on a diet of white flour."
