    "excerpt": "In 1909 I\nwrote an article for European health magazines\ndenouncing the metabolic theory and in 1912\nlearned that Dr.  Thomas Powell of Los Angeles had\nmade the same discoveries and was making remark-\nable cures by using foods containing what he called\n\"Organized Carbon\", which is the same food ingre-\ndient that develo...",
