    "excerpt": "In conclusion, I want to give you a plain criticism\nof food value, and that without the help of the\nhigh-toned scales of science. \nA severe criticism of food values\nMeat has no nourishment at all for man.  The\nso-called strength, which we experience after eating\nis nothing but stimulation.  Even the meat-eating\nanimals...",
    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — In conclusion, I want to give you a plain criticism\nof food value, and that without the help of the\nhigh-toned scales of science. \nA severe criticism of food values\nMeat has no nourishment at all for man.  The\nso-called strength, which we experience after eating\nis nothing but stimulation.  Even the meat-eating\nanimals will die if you feed them on nothing but\ncooked meat without blood and bones."
