    "excerpt": "What I call the \"Transition\nDiet\" must be a therapeutic system of eating, for\nelimination of waste and toxemias (disease mat-\nters) selected, adjusted and combined in such a\nway that the elimination can be controlled.  Com-\nbined with fasting, we have a system of therapeu-\ntics which surpasses any other in existence. \n...",
    "fullText": "APPENDIX — What I call the \"Transition\nDiet\" must be a therapeutic system of eating, for\nelimination of waste and toxemias (disease mat-\nters) selected, adjusted and combined in such a\nway that the elimination can be controlled.  Com-\nbined with fasting, we have a system of therapeu-\ntics which surpasses any other in existence. \nIf physical culture of any kind is combined with\nthis system, the elimination can be enforced rapid-\nly."
