    "fullText": "APPENDIX — (These ideas may serve as a contribution to the\nPhilosophy of Suffering; or Revelation of all val-\nues. )\n\"I, the Stomach, am the primary ruler over life and\ndeath; from the first primitive intestinal cell, to the\npassing away of the last creature.  My rule over\nliving beings is self-evidentas I am the first decid-\ning court of remedy; of repair; of restoration of the\nfunctional and organic disturbances called disease. \nUnceasingly, with the help of the organs of elimi-\nnation and protection, I am secretely at work; to\nregulate the well-being of man with Edenic reserve\nforces."
