    "fullText": "APPENDIX — This phe-\nnomenon is the health-regulating process of dis-\nease; and\nis lessened both as to quantity and\nfrequency, in proportion to the general efforts at\ncleansing; commencing with me.  It becomes super-\nfluous\nand\ndisappears\nentirely,with\nperfect\nhealthif I am fed exclusively on pure and unmixed\nfood, with fruit, alone.  (For proof; we refer to the\nlives of many saints. ) I am likewise interested in\nthe formation of pure blood in the young man,\nsince the quality of his blood is not only of\nimportance to him; but to his whole future genera-\ntion."
