    "fullText": "RATIONAL FASTING — 148\nRATIONAL FASTING\nthe drainage pipe.  Thru' decades of damming up,\nthere has gathered a mire-like mass beyond descrip-\ntion.  The deep folds conceal heaps of slime and\nfecal matter, in stony formation of many years'\nstanding.  This ulcerating and fermenting depository\nof putrefying refuse of the process of disintegra-\ntion of one's own tissues, is, in conjunction with\nmyself, a first-class hot bed and breeding place of\nall diseases.  Here is the dark, secret, underground\nreservoir of the dietary mire, which is poisoning\nthe blood-stream from childhood on, and, like an\nobscure subterranean spring, is feeding all painful\ndisease symptoms.  There we find the deeper causes\nof apoplexy, neurasthenia, typhus, head troubles,\nkidney and liver infectionsand of the varied list\nof 'specialties' invented by the 'medical brain."
