    "fullText": "and 10 to 15 pounds alone from the colon, mainly consisting of foreign matters, — I had fat patients that eliminated from their body as much as 50 to 60 pounds waste,\nand 10 to 15 pounds alone from the colon, mainly consisting of foreign matters,\nespecially old, hardened feces. The average so-called “healthy” man of today carries\ncontinually with him, since childhood, several pounds of never eliminated feces. One\n“good stool” a day means nothing. A fat and sick man is in fact a living “cesspool”. A\ndistinct surprise to me was that a number of my patients in such condition had already\nundertaken so-called “Nature cures”.\n For further information refer to page 42, “The Magic Mirror”."
