    "fullText": "The Formula of Life — The engineer can figure exactly “E = P − F”, meaning that the amount of energy or\nefficiency “E” he secures from an engine is not equal to the power “P” without first\ndeducting “F', the friction. \nThe ingenious idea of construction of the ideal engine is to make it work with the\nsmallest amount of friction.  Should we transfer this fundamental and principal idea on\nthe human engine, we see that it involves the terrible ignorance of medical physiology\nand that Naturopathy found a true way of healing by removing—eliminating obstructions\n—that is, foreign matters of encumbrance, mucus and its toxemias. \nBut just what vitality really is and how tremendous it can become, what a higher,\nsuperior, absolute health is, has not up to the present date been shown or proven.  I will\nteach in the following lessons a principally different NEW PHYSIOLOGY, based on the\ncorrection of medical errors of blood-circulation, blood-composition, blood-building and\nmetabolism."
