    "fullText": "Critique of All Other Healing Systems — This is the secret: If the body of any sick man endeavors to eliminate poisons\nmanifested by any kind of symptoms and a new and dangerous poison is introduced into\nthe circulation, the elimination thru the symptoms is more or less stopped because the\nbody instinctively sets to work to neutralize these poisons as far as it is possible.  The\nsymptoms return just as soon as the life is saved, and the same procedure is repeated\nuntil the patient dies or—if intelligent enough—casts medicine aside in time and seeks\nto save himself by;\nDrugless Healing\nThe methods of Drugless Healing are also very numerous, and they can be divided into\nthree parts;\n1.  Physical Treatments. \n2.  Mental Treatments. \n3.  Dietetical Treatments. \nPhysical Treatments\nIn general, all physical treatment have a tendency to loosen local constitutional\nencumbrances thru various kinds of vibrations and thermal differences."
