    "fullText": "SUPPER: A combination salad as suggested in the first menu, followed by a baked — This then is why it is of extreme importance that every meal of a diet of healing and\ncleansing must leave the body as soon as possible.  Being mixed with the loosened and\ndissolved poisons they cause these “uncomfortable” conditions—a fact that has never\nbefore been perfectly understood or explained. \nCertain foods prove more laxative under certain conditions.  Therefore, eat the foods\nthat you have personally found to be the most laxative in your own body.  If you do not\nexperience a regular bowel movement before retiring, always help with an enema, a\nlaxative or both.  A natural laxative helps, which you will undoubtedly find very efficient,\nis eating a few dried prunes before the other fruits are taken."
