    "fullText": "thoroughly. — thoroughly.  Serve on crisp lettuce leaves.  Decorate with chopped pimento. \nCarrot and Raisin Salad – Two cups coarsely shredded carrots.  Soak ½ cup seedless\nraisins about 2 hours, ½ cup finely chopped celery.  Mix thoroughly.  Add 2 tablespoons\nmayonnaise. \nStuffed Prune Salad – Fill centers of cooked prunes with cottage cheese.  Place 1\nblanched almond in center of cottage cheese.  Serve on lettuce leaves with mayonnaise. \nCooked Combination Salad – One cup diced cooked carrots, 1 cup cooked peas, 1 cup\nchopped cooked string beans, ½ cup finely chopped raw celery.  Mix thoroughly, add\nmayonnaise.  Serve on crisp lettuce leaves. \nSerbian Slaw – One cup coarsely chopped celery, 1 cup finely sliced cabbage, ¼ cup\nfinely chopped onions, ¼ cup minced olives, 1 tablespoon chopped pimento.  Add oil and\nlemon juice. \nFruit Salad (served in Apple Shells) – Select good looking apples.  Cut off piece of top\nand remove meat of apple."
