    "excerpt": "Thru the above enlightening explanation you see that fasting is; first, a negative\nproposition to relieve the body from direct obstructions of solid, most unnatural foods;\nsecond, that it is a mechanical process of elimination by contracting tissues pressing out\nmucus, causing friction and obstruction in the circulatio...",
    "fullText": "the tissues. — Thru the above enlightening explanation you see that fasting is; first, a negative\nproposition to relieve the body from direct obstructions of solid, most unnatural foods;\nsecond, that it is a mechanical process of elimination by contracting tissues pressing out\nmucus, causing friction and obstruction in the circulation. \nThe following are examples of vitality from “P”, Power, air-pressure alone:\nOne of my first fasters, a relatively healthy vegetarian, walked 45 miles in the\nmountains on his 24th fast day. \nA friend of fifteen years younger and myself walked 56 HOURS CONTINUALLY after a\nten-day fast. \nA German physician, a specialist in fasting cures, published a pamphlet entitled,\n“Fasting, the Increase of Vitality”.  He learned the same fact that I did, but he does not\nknow why and how, and vitality therefore remained mysterious for him."
