    "fullText": "Destructive Diet of Civilization — See Lesson 14 and you will\nfind that Berg's investigations proved to be the same that I found by intuition,\nexperimenting and thru experience with myself and some thousands of patients. \nMEATS\nAll are in a decomposing state, producing cadaver poisons, uric acid in the body and\nmucus; fats are the worst, even butter is unusable for the human body.  No animals eat\nfat. \nEGGS\nEggs are even worse than meats, because not only have eggs too high protein qualities,\nbut they contain a gluey property much worse than meat and are therefore very\nconstipating, quite more so than meat.  Hard boiled eggs are less harmful, because the\ngluey qualities are destroyed; the white of eggs makes a very perfect glue."
