    "fullText": "preparative diet. — Procreation is the most holy and divine act and charged with\nthe highest responsibility, especially on the part of the father.  A germ with the slightest\ndefect is a generation not forward but downward.  In very old and in classic civilization\n“Sex” was a cult, a religion, and in every mystology, poetry of all civilized people, love\nis the great, main and general subject with the conscious or unconscious goal to\nreproduce his kind. \nThe fact is proven by statistics that every family of the city's population dies out,\ndisappears with the third or fourth generation.  In other words, the “sins” of the fathers\nand of the mothers produce diseased children and children's children degenerating into\ndeath with the third generation.  What are these “sins”?  You shall “love thy neighbor”,\nand you do, perhaps, but you kill your own child, partly at least before it is born.  Latent\ndisease is general and universal."
