    "fullText": "Sex (Continued) — Sex (Continued)\nLESSON XXIV. \nMotherhood and Eugenics\nMotherhood with mucusless diet, before, during and after pregnancy is the\ndevelopment towards the Madonna-like, holy purity principally different from the\ndangerous so-called “ordinary” childbirth, with its ever-present risk of life, known in our\npresent civilization. \nIf the female body is perfectly clean thru this diet, the menstruation disappears.  In\nscripture it is called by the significant word “purification”, which it in fact is; clean—no\nlonger polluted by the monthly flow of impure blood and other waste.  This is the ideal\ncondition of an inside purity capable of the “immaculate conception”.  When seen in the\nlight of this truth the entire “Madonna mystery” is easily understood."
