    "fullText": "That is the point that everyone refused to believe, realize or understand. — Eugenics of a Diseaseless, Superior Race\nUsing a plant as a comparison, “motherhood” can be said to represent the QUALITY of\nthe soil; “fatherhood” represents the quality of the seed—of the germ. \nA relatively poor, almost barren soil but a good quality of seed produces a fairly good\nplant, but a defective seed, even though planted in the best of soil, NOTHING. \nBreeders of animals, especially horse breeders, know that the quality of a\nthoroughbred father goes thru endless generations, even spanning over a chain of\n“indifferent” mothers.  This is why inheritance of good and bad qualities (tuberculosis for\ninstance) skips a whole generation. \nAs in every respect of life this problem is different also, and, of course, is different in\nthe case of a clean body on natural diet.  Medical doctors and Naturopaths alike will\nhardly believe at all in the new principles and arguments, which I have brought out, and\npostulated in this work."
