    "fullText": "by yourself and bending movements to the accompaniment of music will prove very — As all of the clothing should be removed during a sunbath, a small enclosure just long\nenough to lay in should be built in your back yard, or even on the roof, away from\nprying, inquisitive eyes.  The clothing of civilization has made it impossible for man to\nsecure his proper quota of the life-giving power of fresh air and sunshine, so essential to\nhealth and happiness.  The direct rays of the sun on the naked body supply the electricity,\nenergy and vitality to the human storage battery, renewing it in vigor, strength and\nvirility. \nInternal Baths\nDuring the transition period, even though you have regular bowel movements, it is\nadvisable to wash out the lower colon.  The sticky waste, slimy mucus and various\npoisons which Nature is attempting to eject should be helped along as much as possible. \nA small bulb infant syringe can be used after the regular bowel movement, but for a\nthorough cleansing from two to three quarts of water should be used."
