    "excerpt": "You must now see why civilization, all religion, all philosophy, with their tremendous\nsacrifice of work, time, money, energy, is and has been part guesswork.  The magic\nformula for “Heaven on Earth”—of the Paradise—must read like this:\n“Eat your way into Paradise physically. ” But you cannot pass the gate, watched ove...",
    "fullText": "“Peace on Earth” happiness and righteousness as yet remain a foolish dream. — You must now see why civilization, all religion, all philosophy, with their tremendous\nsacrifice of work, time, money, energy, is and has been part guesswork.  The magic\nformula for “Heaven on Earth”—of the Paradise—must read like this:\n“Eat your way into Paradise physically. ” But you cannot pass the gate, watched over\nby the angel with the flaming sword, until you have gone through the purgatory\n(cleansing fire) of fasting and diet of healing—a cleansing, a physiological purifying, by\nthe “Flame of Life” in your own body!  During thousands of years no one has escaped the\nstruggle of death caused by an unnatural life, and you will have to face it some day."
