    "excerpt": "OTHER BOOKS BY ARNOLD EHRET\nRATIONAL FASTING for PHYSICAL MENTAL & SPIRITUAL REJUVENATION\nThis thought provoking book by Prof.  Ehret has aided thousands to enjoy health through fasting.  Rational\nFasting also includes, “YOUR ROAD TO REGENERATION” by Prof.  Ehret, “MY ROAD TO HEALTH” and\n“BUILD YOUR OWN ROAD TO HEALTH”...",
    "fullText": "OTHER BOOKS BY ARNOLD EHRET — OTHER BOOKS BY ARNOLD EHRET\nRATIONAL FASTING for PHYSICAL MENTAL & SPIRITUAL REJUVENATION\nThis thought provoking book by Prof.  Ehret has aided thousands to enjoy health through fasting.  Rational\nFasting also includes, “YOUR ROAD TO REGENERATION” by Prof.  Ehret, “MY ROAD TO HEALTH” and\n“BUILD YOUR OWN ROAD TO HEALTH” by Teresa Mitchell, “INTERNAL CLEANLINESS” by Fred S. \nHirsch and “THE DEFINITE CURE OF CHRONIC CONSTIPATION” by Prof.  Ehret. \nTHE CAUSE AND CURE OF HUMAN ILLNESS (Kranke Menschen)\nTranslated by Professor Dr.  Ludwig Max Fischer.  A way to take your health back into your own hands.  A\nsolution to man's modern ailments.  It was proposed and articulated by a nutritionist, Arnold Ehret, in a book\nwritten 100 years ago. \nPAMPHLETS ON EHRET'S TEACHINGS\nTHUS SPEAKETH THE STOMACH also THE TRAGEDY OF NUTRITION\nPHYSICAL FITNESS THRU A SUPERIOR DIET, FASTING AND DIETETICS\nOTHER BOOKS OF INTEREST\nTHE GRAPE CURE by Johanna Brandt."
